      "recursiveNodeCount": 1,
      "treeHash": "c708c89147c86c38bef6ecb5a0d25337b6764cec57172ed40bcac62d4b00f64a",
      "assetRef": null,
      "rawBlockNode": {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "EA4gT",
        "x": 432,
        "y": 27,
        "name": "it",
        "fill": "#222222",
        "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
        "width": 740,
        "content": "我们不仅仅是金属切削刀具制造商，我们还是未来工程师。每一次行业挑战都是在邀请我们进行创新、合作以及打造能够驱动进步的解决方案。",
        "lineHeight": 1.35,
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 30,
        "fontWeight": "600"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "SJrMK",
      "blockName": "iv",
      "blockType": "text",
      "blockRole": "text",
      "order": 1,
      "bounds": {
        "x": 10,
        "y": 339,
        "width": "",
        "height": ""
      },
      "directChildCount": 0,
      "recursiveNodeCount": 1,
      "treeHash": "b7cdbf0341c710f09e4964576f87905e0c01ea2af743a43c050a508facf87499",
      "assetRef": null,
      "rawBlockNode": {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "SJrMK",
        "x": 10,
        "y": 339,
        "name": "iv",
        "fill": "#333333",
        "content": "这对我们而言是“健康”的制造\n",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 20,
        "fontWeight": "600"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "jGzb2",
      "blockName": "it",
      "blockType": "text",
      "blockRole": "text",
      "order": 2,
      "bounds": {
        "x": 432,
        "y": 159,
        "width": 740,
        "height": ""
      },
      "directChildCount": 0,
      "recursiveNodeCount": 1,
      "treeHash": "528d5fdd48be77b728f7f69c0bb1a26033dbb0968327f575a9134d54e4c1c559",
      "assetRef": null,
      "rawBlockNode": {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "jGzb2",
        "x": 432,
        "y": 159,
        "name": "it",
        "fill": "#222222",
        "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
        "width": 740,
        "content": "高品质金属切削刀具和服务，结合最新加工技术。以上是必备要素，但是成功的制造不是单凭设备就能实现的。还关乎认清自我需求并在正确的时间实现价值链的恰当平衡。要使有能力的人通力合作、共享知识 — 无差别，一视同仁。要从80多年的专业技艺中汲取精华，同时促进可持续发展的未来。我们坚信要从整体全面的角度看待制造业，这是一种能够实现长期健康习惯的方式 — 我们信奉“健康”的制造。\n",
        "lineHeight": 1.35,
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "Xz2w4",
      "blockName": "it",
      "blockType": "text",
      "blockRole": "text",
      "order": 3,
      "bounds": {
        "x": 432,
        "y": 335,
        "width": 740,
        "height": ""
      },
      "directChildCount": 0,
      "recursiveNodeCount": 1,
      "treeHash": "6e582c0b053f4cd18f0bcd218ee84e4de252e9afdfd811357ac9ebb9f74eb7b4",
      "assetRef": null,
      "rawBlockNode": {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "Xz2w4",
        "x": 432,
        "y": 335,
        "name": "it",
        "fill": "#222222",
        "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
        "width": 740,
        "content": "所谓“健康”的制造，是一种态度。一种注重制造业内部平衡和健康的态度。一种助力企业繁荣、坚韧、长久变革的态度。凡是我们与客户和伙伴所共同开展的一切，我们都运用这种态度。从削减成本和浪费、提升效率和循环利用率到保持价值链平衡，我们都坚信以下习惯能够成就“健康”的制造：\n",
        "lineHeight": 1.35,
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 18
      }
    }
  ],
